        {
          "text": "Whilst EMA research has shown that parents are more likely to use structure-based feeding practices at mealtimes and during feeding interactions with a positive mealtime atmosphere [5], there has been no examination of the momentary predictors of the use of these feeding prac-tices by parents of children with avid eating behaviour.",
